    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.14,
      "text": "another token in this massive space is not a near miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.72,
      "end": 6.92,
      "text": "It is the literal mechanism of how context gets applied to language."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.62,
      "end": 10.3,
      "text": "As our mutated token traveled through the network layers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.74,
      "end": 14.44,
      "text": "its changing numbers plotted a specific trajectory toward a final location."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.1,
      "end": 17.9,
      "text": "Even though the token's final numbers matched no exact record,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 21.36,
      "text": "out of every meaning AI knows, it sat right next to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.8,
      "end": 23.04,
      "text": "This is vector space."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.1,
      "end": 24.92,
      "text": "Meaning is a position."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.02,
      "end": 27.98,
      "text": "Close in space is close in meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.42,
      "end": 30.1,
      "text": "To an artificial intelligence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.66,
      "end": 34.24,
      "text": "the concept of human meaning is purely an exercise in geometry."
    }
  ],
